[SIZE=6][B]MC Data Bridge - Release Notes (v2.1.5)[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]Overview[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4]Version 2.1.5 is a stability patch focused on maintaining compatibility with the bleeding-edge Paper 26.1 API (Minecraft 1.21.4+). This release addresses a specific serialization issue with modern Adventure text objects and optimizes the plugin's internal dependency structure.[/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]Changes & Fixes[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]🧩 Adventure Text Serialization Patch[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Resolved a [B]NoClassDefFoundError[/B] and serialization failure affecting niche Adventure text components, specifically those used in modern [B]Player Head[/B] metadata.
[*]Aligned internal dependencies with [B]Adventure v4.26.1[/B] to support the latest Minecraft 1.21.4 features.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]🚀 Modern API & Build Stability[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Paper 26.1 Support:[/B] Officially verified compatibility with the latest Paper alpha builds.
[*][B]Dependency Optimization:[/B] Transitioned Adventure libraries to [I]provided[/I] scope, maintaining a lightweight JAR (~3.0M) while ensuring native performance on Paper/Velocity.
[*][B]Clean Source Tree:[/B] Eliminated all experimental stubs and replaced them with correct, version-aligned dependencies.
[/LIST]

[CENTER]----------------------------------------------------------------[/CENTER]
[I]For installation instructions and configuration details, please refer to the README.md and config.yml.[/I]
